# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Phase 0 U1 — repository ignore hygiene
# (docs/01-plan/phase-0-integration-enforcement.plan.md)
# The remote is PUBLIC. These are generated, local, or potentially sensitive
# artifacts that must never be swept into a commit.
# NOTE: these rules prevent FUTURE accidents only. Files already tracked before
# this change stay tracked — see the plan for the separate, approved cleanup.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Playwright output — traces, screenshots, videos, and failure artifacts that
# land in the default outputDir (playwright.config.ts sets trace:
# "on-first-retry"). The glob also covers the stray "test-results 2/" duplicate.
/test-results*/
/playwright-report/
/blob-report/
/.playwright/

# Playwright authentication state — never commit a saved session
storageState*.json
*.auth.json
/.auth/

# bkit local audit + runtime ledgers (per-session, machine-local)
.bkit/audit/
.bkit/runtime/token-ledger.ndjson
.bkit/runtime/first-run-seen.json

# bkit machine-local runtime caches and per-session state. All regenerated on
# demand: cc-version/otel-env/session-ctx-fp are caches, memory-directives is
# derived from CLAUDE.md, and pdca-status/session-history are session telemetry.
# CLAUDE.md §9: the authoritative status record is docs/archive/*/_INDEX.md, not
# bkit tooling state. Directory-level so new bkit runtime files (e.g.
# hook-reachability.json) cannot reintroduce working-tree churn.
# The two explicit rules above are now redundant but retained as documentation.
.bkit/runtime/
.bkit/state/

# bkit PDCA feature ledger — mutated every session and a known concurrent-write
# contention point. Its durable content is mirrored in docs/archive/*/_INDEX.md,
# which CLAUDE.md §9 designates as the reliable record.
/.bkit-memory.json

# graphify generated knowledge graph — 29 MB / 223 files, regenerable via
# `graphify update .` (AST-only, no API cost). Ignored for the same reason as
# .next/ and coverage/. Resolved by plan review finding P-18.
/graphify-out/

# Editor temporary files
*.swp
*.swo
